// Auto-generated compact 5x7-cell font (each glyph is 3px wide, drawn
// into a 5x7 cell so there's built-in letter spacing). Uppercase +
// digits + basic punctuation only -- font5x7_lookup() upper-cases
// lowercase input since there are no separate lowercase glyphs.
